# Files that must never be uploaded to a deployment.
#
# The Vercel CLI uploads the working directory, including files that are
# untracked by git, so anything sensitive or merely unnecessary has to be
# excluded here explicitly.

# Local Supabase CLI state — contains generated local secrets under
# .temp/start-secrets/. Never deploy.
supabase/

# Original-resolution team photographs and bio source text. The site serves
# the converted WebP files in public/images/team/ instead.
about-us/

# Working documents and issued certificates kept in the project root.
*.pdf

# Local test harnesses and evidence.
test-evidence/
.selftest/
scripts/
